  "content": "<center>\n\n![Natural Texture Pack header](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/fb44581e3205bd40b398deb02d9385dc4f775854.png)\n\n<center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">自然材質包</font></strong></span></center>\n<p></p>\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/natural-texture-pack\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/natural\">\n  <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\">\n  <img alt=\"github-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\">\n  <img alt=\"ghsponsors-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/brandonitaly\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p></p>\n\n為你的世界增添更自然的外觀。這是一個基於柔和色彩與線條的材質包。\n<p></p>\n\n此材質包包含方塊、物品、實體與使用者介面的細緻紋理，在不過度偏離原版遊戲風格的前提下，提供更精緻的視覺感受。\n<p></p>\n\n<details open>\n<summary>預覽</summary>\n\n![世界預覽](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/7485212caea176aedfec6dedeefdd8c379af8a5e.jpeg)\n\n![櫻花林](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/8385b990fc6950736db75dd81bafe71a1b4d2164.png)\n\n![平原村莊](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/b6e9a1e2c16c84ba0f947ca28611c4843feddcf3.png)\n\n![沙漠中駱駝與灰貓坐在一起](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/5952ce907b652378717f5052b26468323544dbb6.png)\n\n![珊瑚礁](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/11769a64aca6bfac821faf64cfc7ba7b9c74ceb3.png)\n\n![使用者介面](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/02c27694a1daf11cf61a4d1c7afe4b110edf08ed.png)\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>更多資源包</summary>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th align=\"center\">圖示</th>\n      <th>名稱</th>\n      <th>下載次數</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/meEXwbr9/770e36a855375d291ea82a6cb093a9340b5e38cc.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Plastic Texture Pack icon\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/plastic-texture-pack\">塑膠材質包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/plastic-texture-pack?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mXZavX3c/77241b565d355ba5369dbb1bee133a266f08aea9.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Halloween Mash-up icon\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/halloween-mash-up\">萬聖節混搭包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/halloween-mash-up?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/57a0658dbfb9fc3d7b2ca4ddfa9f7439540ca8c7.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Natural Texture Pack icon\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/natural-texture-pack\">自然材質包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/natural-texture-pack?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n    <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/pE8Ji9UH/267efb1f2bbe4b0c30fd00167e038a23b2a24e7e.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Festive Mash-up icon\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/festive-mash-up\">節慶混搭包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/festive-mash-up?logo=Modrinth&label